# Session handoff. Local only: this repository is public, and the handoff is
# working notes — the one file most likely to name a real domain, address, or
# inbox in passing. It stays on disk for the next session and never in a commit.
# (This overrides the usual convention of landing handoff.md on main.)
handoff.md
